                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2231/174: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Ecuador</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Gonzalez</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-07-21T15:00:00-04:00">July 21, 1937—3 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>24. Legation’s 34, July 19. Telegraph which products in proposed Schedule I are
                    affected and what new rates will be.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
